# Energy Demand Response

Aggregator flexibility assessment, shared-resource planning and measured settlement. SAREF4ENER provides semantic references; commercial rules are local extensions. Plans are not actuals; unknown is not zero. Dates are day-only, peak_a is2hours and peak_b is3hours, not instantaneous dispatch. Discover3functions,2snapshot metrics and the investigation Skill through standard capabilities.
